     <period-end iso-date="2027-06-01"></period-end>
     <target value="14">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In FY24, the tax-to-GDP ratio experienced a decline compared to the baseline, primarily due to temporary shocks affecting major revenue sources. However, preliminary estimates for FY25 suggest a recovery, with the tax-to-GDP ratio expected to rebound. Overall, these trends suggest that the earlier decline was an exceptional event, largely attributable to unfavorable macroeconomic conditions.</narrative>
